  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "This paper studies uncertainty quantification in a quantum-classical hybrid supply-chain digital twin using a 4-qubit base circuit scaled to 16 qubits. Reported predictive performance is roughly comparable between classical and hybrid models (R2 ≈ 0.79, RMSE ≈ 0.78, MAE ≈ 0.75), while uncertainty metrics differ: for example, HQBRR has uncertainty-error correlation 0.0229 and PICP 0.96, and HQNN has PICP 0.6167 versus 0.6233 for NN.",
